{
 "id": 798380,
 "name": "Record Salesforce accounts > 500 employees to Google Sheets",
 "description": "1. An account with more than 500 employees is created in Salesforce.\n2. Workato records the account in Google Sheets as a new row.\n\n**Requirements**\nTo test this recipe, copy [the sample Google Sheet here](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19hoKsJ1hi4Sk_RXURnF1Zb0iJFC5Adl_mFP1UzNXgF0/edit#gid=0) to your Google Drive account.",
